#: ../../source/docs/common-efi.rst:12 efccc8e6b0db404ab5f804578791c9b9
msgid ""
"ArduPilot provides support for several types of electronic fuel injection "
"controllers for :ref:`internal combustion engines<common-ice>`. Both CAN and"
" Serial communication interfaces to the EFI are supported."
msgstr ""
"ArduPilot 为 :ref:`内燃机<common-ice>` 的多种电子燃油喷射控制器提供支持。支持通过 CAN 和串口通信接口连接 EFI。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-efi.rst:14 55342f3e4f9049d5b74feaa8448aa991
