#: ../../source/docs/common-efi.rst:78 97b4e18a8fec48b7a15040509cad3729
msgid ""
"Some EFIs connect to the autopilot via MAVLink, instead of by a Serial port "
"or DroneCAN. The following parameter should be set to connect such an EFI "
"via MAVLink:"
msgstr "某些 EFI 通过 MAVLink 而非串口或 DroneCAN 连接到飞控。应设置以下参数以通过 MAVLink 连接此类 EFI："

