"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/libraries/AP_Scripting/drivers/EFI_DLA.md>`__"
" for details."
msgstr ""
"驱动通过 :ref:`LUA <common-lua-scripts>` 脚本提供。请参阅 LUA 脚本设置说明和 `DLA EFI Lua md 文件"
" "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/libraries/AP_Scripting/drivers/EFI_DLA.md>`__"
" 了解详情。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-efi.rst:90 8851bb6f3dcd4300a8584da7ad521b09
msgid "Setup using LUA script drivers"
msgstr "使用 LUA 脚本驱动进行设置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-efi.rst:92 ecc620682ba94072a072798ba89fc72b
msgid ""
"Be sure your autopilot is capable of running LUA scripts. See :ref:`binary-"
"features` listing for your autopilot and be sure it does NOT list "
"\"SCRIPTING\" under \"Other\" features as missing."
msgstr ""
"确保你的飞控能够运行 LUA 脚本。查看你的飞控的 :ref:`binary-features` "
"列表，确保它在「其他」功能下没有列出「脚本」为缺失功能。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-efi.rst:93 b35fe8c7e1bd49afab2707f04b70d811
msgid "Setup :ref:`LUA Scripting <common-lua-scripts>`"
msgstr "设置 :ref:`LUA 脚本 <common-lua-scripts>`"

#: ../../source/docs/common-efi.rst:94 71086c462f1841009409931138ccb626
msgid ""
"Copy the appropriate driver script to your autopilot SD card from the `LUA "
"Driver directory "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/tree/master/libraries/AP_Scripting/drivers>`__"
msgstr ""
"从 `LUA 驱动目录 "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/tree/master/libraries/AP_Scripting/drivers>`__"
" 将相应的驱动脚本复制到飞控 SD 卡"

#: ../../source/docs/common-efi.rst:95 60cf614e2c4742cdb760d64b0d582197
msgid "Follow the instructions in the driver's \".md\" file."
msgstr "按照驱动的「.md」文件中的说明操作。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-efi.rst:98 7cf6b0ae327e4f25b25cc97f4167a2a8
msgid "Using a Battery Monitor to Report Fuel Flow and Consumption"
msgstr "使用电池监测器报告燃油流量和消耗"

#: ../../source/docs/common-efi.rst:100 3b12d84faa724d468d026f73dacdd8ee
msgid ""
"If an EFI is used in the system, either thru a LUA driver or the built-in "
"drivers above, the fuel flow and consumption can be monitored using "
":ref:`BATT_MONITOR<BATT_MONITOR>` = 27. The fuel flow in liters/hour will be"
" reported as amps, while the fuel consumed in milliliters will be reported "
"as mah."
msgstr ""
"如果系统中使用了 EFI（无论是通过 LUA 驱动还是上述内置驱动），可以使用 :ref:`BATT_MONITOR<BATT_MONITOR>` = "
"27 来监测燃油流量和消耗。燃油流量（升/小时）将以安培报告，而燃油消耗（毫升）将以 mah 报告。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-efi.rst:102 0f761e7941db4ef48776d09e991ea016
msgid ""
"the MAVLink command to reset the fuel consumed does not work with this "
"monitor."
msgstr "重置已消耗燃油的 MAVLink 命令不适用于此监测器。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-efi.rst:105 a063d239cb164ff986f2c2adde3e7133
msgid "Displaying EFI telemetry in Mission Planner"
msgstr "在 Mission Planner 中显示 EFI 数传数据"

#: ../../source/docs/common-efi.rst:107 aaa7b4cf4b5842f0ab80601ab9b27d53
msgid ""
"The following EFI telemetry is available in the Mission Planner. Just right "
"click in the DATA screens HUD display and select ``User Items``. Then select"
" what data to display."
msgstr ""
"以下 EFI 数传数据可在 Mission Planner 中获取。只需在数据界面的 HUD 显示上右键单击并选择 ``User "
"Items``，然后选择要显示的数据。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-efi.rst:113 db58af8803894cbbb64cd32e5bc0b33b
msgid "Using the EFI RPM in ArduPilot"
msgstr "在 ArduPilot 中使用 EFI RPM"

#: ../../source/docs/common-efi.rst:115 44af754c51a0449cab56c75276d3e103
msgid ""
"The EFI's rpm telemetry can be used as the autopilot's RPM sensor, for "
"display in the GCS as above, or for use with the harmonic notch filter."
msgstr "EFI 的 RPM 数传可用作飞控的 RPM 传感器，用于在地面站显示（如上所述），或用于谐波陷波滤波器。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-efi.rst:117 9158a992d6464fe3b6883af920e4322f
msgid ""
"First, set either RPM1 or RPM2 sensor as being sourced from the EFI "
"(examples will use RPM1):"
msgstr "首先，将 RPM1 或 RPM2 传感器之一设置为来自 EFI（示例将使用 RPM1）："

#: ../../source/docs/common-efi.rst:119 9715efb52c804f74acef4d6d0129f93f
msgid "set :ref:`RPM1_TYPE<RPM1_TYPE>` = 3 (EFI)"
msgstr "设置 :ref:`RPM1_TYPE<RPM1_TYPE>` = 3（EFI）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-efi.rst:120 60c3d37ec6a44fdc95c5e27d49a34f92
msgid "then setup the :ref:`common-rpm-based-notch`"
msgstr "然后设置 :ref:`common-rpm-based-notch`"

#: ../../source/docs/common-efi.rst:123 b50c7ccecf084c708252c93bb30b009a
msgid "Throttle Linearization"
msgstr "油门线性化"

#: ../../source/docs/common-efi.rst:125 c77bd8de6dc24c8c9f730f7f4ce4f5ea
msgid ""
"Some serial EFIs use the ArduPilot throttle output PWM value to control the "
"throttle instead of a servo. Often the engine thrust is not a linear "
"relation to this value. ArduPilot provides up to a third order polynomial "
"curve fit for PWM versus control value sent to the EFI by changing the "
"following parameters from their default values (which is a linear fit):"
msgstr ""
"某些串口 EFI 使用 ArduPilot 的油门输出 PWM 值来控制油门，而不是舵机。通常发动机推力与该值并非线性关系。ArduPilot "
"通过以下参数从默认值更改来提供 PWM 与发送到 EFI 的控制值之间最高三阶多项式曲线拟合（默认为线性拟合）："

#: ../../source/docs/common-efi.rst:127 6cc106a3818c4dc38abcec032eeffe6b
msgid ""
":ref:`EFI_THRLIN_EN<EFI_THRLIN_EN>` = 1 to enable, then refresh parameters "
"or reboot to show:"
msgstr ":ref:`EFI_THRLIN_EN<EFI_THRLIN_EN>` = 1 以启用，然后刷新参数或重启以显示："

#: ../../source/docs/common-efi.rst:128 520e91e08a594745b0043ee4fc35f51c
msgid ""
":ref:`EFI_THRLIN_COEF1<EFI_THRLIN_COEF1>` First order polynomial fit term"
msgstr ":ref:`EFI_THRLIN_COEF1<EFI_THRLIN_COEF1>` 一阶多项式拟合项"

#: ../../source/docs/common-efi.rst:129 a82277200f04419391fab383e011234c
msgid ""
":ref:`EFI_THRLIN_COEF2<EFI_THRLIN_COEF2>` Second order polynomial fit term"
msgstr ":ref:`EFI_THRLIN_COEF2<EFI_THRLIN_COEF2>` 二阶多项式拟合项"

#: ../../source/docs/common-efi.rst:130 e15c478dafa7499cac873aa7e997157d
msgid ""
":ref:`EFI_THRLIN_COEF3<EFI_THRLIN_COEF3>` Third order polynomial fit term"
msgstr ":ref:`EFI_THRLIN_COEF3<EFI_THRLIN_COEF3>` 三阶多项式拟合项"

#: ../../source/docs/common-efi.rst:131 c6138fb2f107414c9787b785a27ac4b1
msgid ":ref:`EFI_THRLIN_OFS<EFI_THRLIN_OFS>` Offset term"
msgstr ":ref:`EFI_THRLIN_OFS<EFI_THRLIN_OFS>` 偏移项"

#: ../../source/docs/common-efi.rst:133 8f4c33d022a54117930254ef938a0efd
msgid "throttle values are modified as:"
msgstr "油门值的修改方式为："

#: ../../source/docs/common-efi.rst:135 a341fa3b7c834d6c947e299b876a2099
msgid "ArduPilot scaled throttle output value = thr"
msgstr "ArduPilot 缩放后的油门输出值 = thr"

#: ../../source/docs/common-efi.rst:137 9dc8fc9f28a64865bec0f9b53700dde8
msgid ""
"modified throttle = (EFI_THRLIN_COEF3 * thr^3 + EFI_THRLIN_COEF2 * thr^2 + "
"EFI_THRLIN_COEF1 * thr) + EFI_THRLIN_OFS"
msgstr ""
"修改后的油门 = (EFI_THRLIN_COEF3 * thr^3 + EFI_THRLIN_COEF2 * thr^2 + "
"EFI_THRLIN_COEF1 * thr) + EFI_THRLIN_OFS"

#: ../../source/docs/common-efi.rst:139 2a13d38b44ec4616ad356489a76a24b8
msgid ""
"This allows the non-linearity to be compensated. The values for these "
"parameters should be obtained from the EFI manufacturer, if applicable."
msgstr "这允许补偿非线性。这些参数的值应从 EFI 制造商处获取（如适用）。"
